    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawn to Drift</strong>\u00a0is a competetive space racing game where you race on player built tracks for the best times to claim your rank on the global leaderboards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create cool tracks in the powerful built-in track editor and upload them for  all players to compete on.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=720 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique multiplayer system where you can race and chat with all players competing on the same track! Meet up with friends, make friends or find a new rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawn to Drift</strong>\u00a0is a competetive space racing game where you race on player built tracks for the best times to claim your rank on the global leaderboards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/bdab27d8f18c9b801a63300df604d954.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create cool tracks in the powerful built-in track editor and upload them for  all players to compete on.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=720 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/3686a1ec8f956d0e6bf900c9ab2ca56c.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique multiplayer system where you can race and chat with all players competing on the same track! Meet up with friends, make friends or find a new rival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.poster.avif?t=1749824416\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.webm?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/a35271de42f3b39e7a0d480e8247a32e.mp4?t=1749824416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
